Sval: a generic id for standard-mapped gamepads

A new RFPTarget, GamepadIdGeneric, makes Gamepad.id read "Standard Gamepad"
for a gamepad whose mapping is "standard", in place of the vendor and
product ids and device name. The standard mapping already gives every button
its meaning, so games keep working; a gamepad without one keeps its id,
which a page needs to map its buttons. RFPTarget::Gamepad, which hides
gamepads entirely, stays a strict choice.

No chrome API can change what Gamepad.id reports.

